===== 2. from the HOST: is an internal-only container reachable? =====
  a0pc-pg = 172.31.77.3
  host -> 172.31.77.3:5432 CONNECTED -- the internal net is one-way: no egress out, but ingress from the host owner

===== 3. with the services up, is the internal client's OWN egress still blocked? =====
