  DIRECT ('1.1.1.1', 443)         -> [Errno 101] Network is unreachable
  DIRECT ('8.8.8.8', 53)          -> [Errno 101] Network is unreachable

===== 4. dual-home a0pc-redis and a0pc-pg onto the default bridge -- does the worker gain an uplink? =====
  a0pc-pg: a0pc-internal(172.31.77.3) bridge(172.17.0.4)
