  client -> 1.1.1.1:443          : [Errno 101] Network is unreachable
  client -> bridge-side redis IP : 
===== 5. the service's OWN reachability follows its interfaces, not its callers =====
  redis (dual-homed) -> model endpoint: REACHABLE
  redis (internal-only) -> model endpoint: NOT reachable

